{
  "_about": "Image-setting values exactly as OJS 3.5.0.2 stores them (shapes copied from the production database, 2026-10-27). `expected` is the file OJS actually writes to disk: for JSON/serialized settings that is `uploadName` (OJS lib/pkp/classes/services/PKPContextService.php:826 reads `$setting['uploadName']`); `name` is only the original filename of the upload. Do not edit `expected` to match the parser — fix the parser. See #148, #239.",
